## Summary
This article introduces a mini quiz for learning cafe-related expressions in Korean. It includes example sentences and prompts users to test their vocabulary on coffee and cafes. The content is designed for language learning purposes.

## Key Points
- The article focuses on teaching cafe-specific Korean phrases.
- It provides example sentences for practical use, such as transitioning from a meal to a cafe.
- It includes an interactive quiz format to enhance vocabulary practice.


